         <div class="section program-cards">
            <div class="container">
               <div class="row programs-intro">
                  <h2>Explore Career Communities</h2>
                  <p><span>Start your journey within our Career Communities. Each community is designed to connect
                        your program of study with relevant information, resources, networking opportunities,
                        and regional employers. Explore below to find programs that match your interests and
                        career goals.</span></p>
               </div>
